            "categoryTitle": "Boss mechanics",
            "categoryDescription": "Using a custom made animator manager, the final boss could be animated in tandem with its abilities such as the spitballs and falling platforms. This is derived from the same manager script that controls the smaller entities such as the player and level enemies.\n\nThe falling gamemode is a minigame level between the main level and the boss level. Its a simple dodging level where the obstacles spawn at random points and speeds.",
