        {
            "categoryTitle": "Shaders",
            "categoryDescription": "Some contributions to the project include the use of shaders to create a toon effect. Using a lighting library and cel shading technique the lighting applied to the materials create bands of light instead of gradients. The black outline is created by a screen shader, and tapers with distance to avoid same-thickness outlines across a distance.\n\nVfx such as dust, paper and sunbeams were added for extra environmental visuals.",
